eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-12T00:02:29Z","updated_at":"2026-01-12T00:15:44Z","body":"This is not a regression issue.\n\n> Bisected to [f29a7d3](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/f29a7d302e0de7eb4b10f57c849d369210c1be55) ([#64351](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/64351)) \n\nIts parent commit can still reproduce the issue. \n\nFurthermore, #64351 only modifies the calculation order during drawing (`NOTIFICATION_DRAW`). It fills the elements within the space defined by the `size`. The issue of inconsistent sizes should be addressed in `*Button::get_minimum_size()`.\n\nThis is essentially a calculation issue, not only a drawing issue.\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3736449116/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4832855245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114831#issuecomment-4832855245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114831","id":4832855245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIA-EzQ","user":{"login":"Kazox61","id":93524528,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZMSMA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93524528?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61","html_url":"https://github.com/Kazox61","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Kazox61/subscriptions","organizations_url